# ADR-001-E: Real-Time Infrastructure

**Status:** Accepted

## Decision

The platform will use WebSockets for real-time communication.

### Technology Stack

* Node.js
* Socket.IO
* Redis Pub/Sub

### Supported Use Cases

* Occupancy updates
* Flash deal notifications
* Reservation status updates
* ETA tracking
* Restaurant demand alerts

## Consequences

* Redis becomes a mandatory infrastructure dependency.
* Real-time performance becomes an MVP KPI.

